{
  "name": "server",
  "$schema": "../../node_modules/nx/schemas/project-schema.json",
  "sourceRoot": "apps/server/src",
  "projectType": "application",
  "tags": ["scope:server-app"],
  "targets": {
    "build": {
      "executor": "@nx/js:swc",
      "outputs": ["{options.outputPath}"],
      "options": {
        "outputPath": "apps/server/dist",
        "main": "apps/server/src/main.ts",
        "tsConfig": "apps/server/tsconfig.app.json",
        "assets": [
          "apps/server/src/assets",
          {
            "glob": "**/*.xdb",
            "input": "apps/server/src/security/data",
            "output": "./security/data"
          }
        ],
        "swcrc": "apps/server/.swcrc",
        "stripLeadingPaths": true
      },
      "configurations": {
        "production": {
          "skipTypeCheck": false
        },
        "development": {
          "skipTypeCheck": false
        }
      }
    },
    "prune-lockfile": {
      "dependsOn": ["build"],
      "cache": true,
      "executor": "@nx/js:prune-lockfile",
      "outputs": [
        "{workspaceRoot}/apps/server/dist/package.json",
        "{workspaceRoot}/apps/server/dist/pnpm-lock.yaml"
      ],
      "options": {
        "buildTarget": "build"
      }
    },
    "copy-workspace-modules": {
      "dependsOn": ["build"],
      "cache": true,
      "outputs": ["{workspaceRoot}/apps/server/dist/workspace_modules"],
      "executor": "@nx/js:copy-workspace-modules",
      "options": {
        "buildTarget": "build"
      }
    },
    "prune": {
      "dependsOn": ["prune-lockfile", "copy-workspace-modules"],
      "executor": "nx:noop"
    },
    "serve": {
      "continuous": true,
      "executor": "nx:run-commands",
      "dependsOn": ["build"],
      "options": {
        "command": "node --watch dist/main.js",
        "cwd": "apps/server"
      }
    },
    "build:watch": {
      "continuous": true,
      "executor": "@nx/js:swc",
      "outputs": ["{options.outputPath}"],
      "options": {
        "outputPath": "apps/server/dist",
        "main": "apps/server/src/main.ts",
        "tsConfig": "apps/server/tsconfig.app.json",
        "assets": ["apps/server/src/assets"],
        "swcrc": "apps/server/.swcrc",
        "stripLeadingPaths": true,
        "watch": true
      }
    },
    "lint": {
      "executor": "nx:run-commands",
      "options": {
        "command": "eslint src test",
        "cwd": "apps/server"
      }
    },
    "typecheck": {
      "//": [
        "🚨 **本 target 不产出任何文件** —— 走 type-check-only 入口 tsconfig.typecheck.json（`noEmit`,",
        "`composite:false`, 无 references）。这是 2026-08-09 的根治：它把 typecheck 从「.d.ts 的第二个",
        "生产者」降级成纯读者，与 `build` 再无共享产物，竞态从此**结构性**不存在。",
        "此前的形态是 `tsc --build tsconfig.json --emitDeclarationOnly`，与 build(@nx/js:swc,",
        "skipTypeCheck:false) 争同一批 .d.ts 与同一份 tsbuildinfo，而 build 会清空 outputPath `dist`",
        "⇒ 并发时类型塌成 {} → TS7006 落在**与改动毫无关系的文件**上（#816、PR #9 两次命中）。",
        "当时靠 dependsOn 定序压住，代价是**每新增一个碰 dist 的 target 都得记得补一条** —— PR #9",
        "正是这么漏的（runtime-smoke 内部会再跑一次 nx build server）。现在两条定序都已删除。",
        "⚠️ 别把 dependsOn 加回来：它已无必要，加回去只会白白串行化、并让人误以为还有耦合。",
        "⚠️ 别改回 `tsc --build`：`--noEmit` 与 `--build` 不兼容（TS 官方，microsoft/TypeScript#53979",
        "至今 open），改回去就等于把第二个生产者请回来。覆盖面对比与业界依据见该 tsconfig 的注释。"
      ],
      "executor": "nx:run-commands",
      "options": {
        "command": "tsc -p tsconfig.typecheck.json",
        "cwd": "apps/server"
      }
    },
    "test": {
      "executor": "nx:run-commands",
      "options": {
        "command": "vitest run --reporter=default",
        "cwd": "apps/server"
      }
    },
    "test:watch": {
      "continuous": true,
      "executor": "nx:run-commands",
      "options": {
        "command": "vitest",
        "cwd": "apps/server"
      }
    },
    "runtime-smoke": {
      "//": [
        "🚨 `build` 是**真语义依赖**，不是定序权宜：smoke 跑的就是 `dist/**/*.js`",
        "（`server-boot-smoke.ts` 从 dist import app.module，理由见该文件头注释）。",
        "⚠️ **别删它**：该脚本第 1/6 步自己还会跑一次 `nx build server`（'ensure fresh dist'）。",
        "没有这条边时它是根任务，那次内部 build 可与外层 `server:build` 并发 —— 两个进程清/写同一",
        "个 `dist`。这是按构造推出的风险（未实测复现），但边本身按语义就该存在，故不留这个口子。",
        "⚠️ 曾短暂挂过 `dependsOn: [\"typecheck\"]`（PR #11），那是 typecheck 还在产 .d.ts 时代的",
        "权宜；typecheck 改 noEmit 入口后已无必要，故换成本条语义正确的 `build`。"
      ],
      "dependsOn": ["build"],
      "executor": "nx:run-commands",
      "options": {
        "command": "pnpm tsx scripts/ci/server-boot-smoke.ts",
        "cwd": "{workspaceRoot}"
      }
    },
    "export-openapi": {
      "executor": "nx:run-commands",
      "dependsOn": ["build"],
      "outputs": ["{workspaceRoot}/apps/server/openapi.json"],
      "options": {
        "command": "PORT=3099 node dist/main.js & until curl -sf http://localhost:3099/docs-json > openapi.json 2>/dev/null; do sleep 0.5; done && lsof -tnP -i:3099 | xargs kill -9 2>/dev/null || true",
        "cwd": "apps/server",
        "env": {
          "MARKETDATA_PROVIDER": "mock"
        }
      }
    },
    "marketdata-backfill": {
      "executor": "nx:run-commands",
      "dependsOn": ["build"],
      "options": {
        "command": "node dist/marketdata/marketdata-backfill.cli.js",
        "cwd": "apps/server"
      }
    },
    "marketdata-trigger": {
      "executor": "nx:run-commands",
      "dependsOn": ["build"],
      "options": {
        "command": "node dist/marketdata/marketdata-trigger.cli.js",
        "cwd": "apps/server"
      }
    },
    "alert-eval": {
      "executor": "nx:run-commands",
      "dependsOn": ["build"],
      "options": {
        "command": "node dist/alert/alert-eval.cli.js",
        "cwd": "apps/server"
      }
    }
  }
}
